[{"code":"list_still_used","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":29,"col":5},"end":{"line":29,"col":16}},"title":"LIST CHANGED WHILE STILL IN USE","message":"`<update>` changes `model.items` in place, but another part of the same\noperation reads the same list.\n\n29|    Tea.sandbox { settings | update = λ_ model → { model | items = List.push model.items 8 } }\n       ^^^^^^^^^^^ the runtime hands `<update>` the model here\n\nIf the list were changed in place, the other part would read it changed.\n\nCopy the list with `List.copy` where the model gets it, so that nothing else\nholds the list `<update>` changes.\n\nThis is sharing the checker can see: two parts of one operation reach the same\nlist."},{"code":"list_may_be_shared","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":29,"col":68},"end":{"line":29,"col":91}},"title":"LIST MAY BE SHARED","message":"`List.push` changes `model.items` in place, and the function that does it goes\nwhere the checker cannot see every call of it: it is stored in a record.\n\n29|    Tea.sandbox { settings | update = λ_ model → { model | items = List.push model.items 8 } }\n                                                                      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ the list is changed in place here\n\nTo be safe, change a copy:\n\n29|    Tea.sandbox { settings | update = λ_ model → { model | items = List.push (List.copy model.items) 8 } }\n\nThis is a limit of the checker, not proof of sharing: a call it cannot see may\nhand the function a list something else still holds."}]
